<title>HONG KONG: Swire sells office floor for HK$173.7 mln.</title>
<headline>Swire sells office floor for HK$173.7 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swire Properties Ltd, a unit of Swire Pacific Ltd, sold the 23th floor of its Island Tower office development in Hong Kong's North Point district for HK$173.7 million, a group spokeswoman said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;This brought total sales of Island Tower to 20 floors for a total of HK$2.4 billion,&quot; she told Reuters.</p>
</text>
